# The Ultimate Doom E3M2 (M9): from the map's start, no monsters: the player walks to the exit,
# through the doors on the way (and the keys they need), and leaves the level, the last
# tic. Written by tools/RouteGen (doom-e3m2-walk-exit).
iwad doom
map E3M2
exit normal
